OL,3,GNEWSA'Having a guide dog has been a
OL,4,Agamechanger'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman, who is registered blind, has
OL,7,Fsaid getting a guide dog has been a
OL,8,F"gamechanger" for her life and has
OL,9,Fbrought her new confidence.
OL,11,FLorna Davies, 36, said she used to
OL,12,F"fold up" her cane and "pretend she was
OL,13,Fok", but "you can't do that with a
OL,14,Fdog".
OL,16,FIt was her husband who applied on her
OL,17,Fbehalf to be partnered with a dog by
OL,18,Fthe Guide Dogs charity because she had
OL,19,Fbeen "anxious" and struggled to accept
OL,20,Fshe needed one.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
