OL,3,GNEWSA'Having a guide dog has been a
OL,4,Agamechanger'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLorna, from Darlington, was teamed up
OL,7,Fwith Yarren in 2020 and conceded "it
OL,8,Fwas the best thing [my husband]
OL,9,Fcould've done for me".
